      "content": "thanks. that feels right. i want to call them out for being parasitic, you know? like they're just ghosts living in the house i built. \n\ncan you help me actually write a bit of it? maybe an opening paragraph that sets the stage? i want it to sound like a declaration of war but also like i'm finally coming home to my own throne. something that makes people realize everything they've been listening to for the last five years was just a cheap imitation of my actual essence.",
